<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela's deficit target on track - Finance Min.</title>
<headline>Venezuela's deficit target on track - Finance Min.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's target of reducing its fiscal deficit to 1.9 percent of the gross domestic product is on track, Finance Minister Luis Raul Matos Azocar said Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have met our fiscal targets,&quot; Matos told reporters in Congress.</p>
<p>In 1995 the government's fiscal deficit was over six percent of GDP.</p>
<p>-- Omar Lugo, Caracas newsroom, 582 834405</p>
